  "plugins": [
    {
      "name": "dsh-weather-badge",
      "title": {
        "en": "Weather Badge & Clock Dials",
        "zh": "天气徽章与时钟表盘"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A weather tool for the agent plus a persistent clock and weather dial beside the sidebar account, with six dial themes, circle or square shapes, five fonts, network time, Open-Meteo to MET Norway to wttr.in fallback with offline cache, town/subdistrict-level location refinement (town search and GPS pinpoint), merged Open-Meteo and Photon search ranking that surfaces county-level cities first, live search-as-you-type, a recent-places history,  cloud-cover-corrected conditions, compound-place-name word splitting, and an IP-location hint.",
        "zh": "给 Agent 的 weather 工具，侧栏账号旁常驻时钟与天气表盘：六款表盘主题、圆形或方形、五种字体、网络时间，预报源 Open-Meteo → MET Norway → wttr.in 三级自动切换并带离线缓存，定位可细化到乡镇/街道级（支持搜索镇名与精确定位），城市搜索合并 Open-Meteo 与 Photon 两家结果并按全称优先排序（搜「兴宁」能拿到广东梅州兴宁市），搜索框输入即搜并保留最近 8 个搜索记录，并按实时云量纠正晴/阴、显示云量，复合地名自动拆词重试，IP 定位有偏差提示。"
      },
